# Local-only seeded kiosk fixture.
# Set to "true" to render the full shop/barber kiosk mission from an in-memory
# fixture — no Supabase row, no Stripe, no device session. Ignored entirely when
# NODE_ENV=production. Leave unset everywhere except a local machine.
#   Shop kiosk:   /kiosk/shop/kiosk-local-fixture-shop
#   Barber kiosk: /kiosk/barber/kiosk-local-fixture-barber
#   Staff exit PIN: 2468
KIOSK_LOCAL_FIXTURE=
